<v Jonathan Manjivar>No hands go up.

00:35:09.500 --> 00:35:26.990
<v Eric Klinenberg>That's insane. There's not one person that believes that someone could lose track of something anymore. OK. So she said, I'm sorry. I lost track of your email and forgot to respond, but I'd love to grab a drink if you're free this week. So she wrote that on Friday at 12:45.

