00:36:09.620 --> 00:36:32.600
<v Aziz Ansari>And then you wrote a message a few days later. And this is two messages, OK. You said, "Hey there. How'd your Thanksgiving feast turn out?" Question mark. "Here's a shot of the spread I put together. I'd say it came out all right." Smiley face. "Yo. I know it's tiny, but I promise, it looks delicious."

00:36:32.600 --> 00:36:39.650
<v Jonathan Manjivar>Guy number four got someone's number at a wedding. She left the wedding. And then not long after, he texted her.

00:36:39.650 --> 00:36:50.880
